{"id":"too-enough","lv":"a2","n":30,"cat":"adjectives","t":"Too và enough","en":"too hot · big enough · too much / many","sum":"Too + tính từ = quá mức, gây ra vấn đề: This coffee is too hot to drink. Tính từ + enough = đủ: She's not old enough to drive. Enough + danh từ: enough time, enough money. Too much + không đếm được, too many + đếm được. Người Việt khen “ngon quá!” — tiếng Anh khen dùng so / really / very (It's so good!); too good nghe lạ vì too mang ý tiêu cực. Very chỉ nhấn mạnh; too kéo theo vấn đề.","forms":[{"f":"too + tính từ (+ to V)","vi":"too hot to drink"},{"f":"tính từ + enough (+ to V)","vi":"old enough to drive"},{"f":"enough + danh từ","vi":"enough time · enough money"},{"f":"too much + không đếm được · too many + đếm được","vi":"too much sugar · too many people"}],"pts":[{"id":"too-enough","name":"too / enough","vi":"Too + tính từ (+ to V); tính từ + enough (+ to V); enough + danh từ"}],"cast":{"ben":{"name":{"en":"Ben","vi":"Ben"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"jacket","top":"#5A6B8C","topShade":"#4A5A78","accent":"#4A5F8F","hair":"short","hairColor":"#B8863B"},"x":1040},"jay":{"name":{"en":"Jay","vi":"Jay"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"apron","top":"#2E2E2E","topShade":"#222222","accent":"#707070","hair":"short","hairColor":"#1F1B1A","skin":"#A86F4C","skinShade":"#93603F"},"x":560}},"bg":"cafe","props":[{"id":"mug","x":820}],"beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Here's your coffee.","vi":"Cà phê của anh đây.","ipa":["hɪɹz","jɔɹ","ˈkɑfi"],"who":"jay","ann":{"expression":"happy","prop":"mug"},"b":1,"start":0.454,"end":1.364,"timing":[[0,0.454],[1,0.682],[2,0.825]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Thanks. Ouch! It's too hot to drink!","vi":"Cảm ơn. Á! Nóng quá, không uống được!","ipa":["θæŋks","aʊtʃ","ɪts","tu","hɑt","tu","dɹɪŋk"],"who":"ben","ann":{"expression":"surprised"},"b":1,"start":2.154,"end":5.884,"timing":[[0,2.154],[1,3.298],[2,4.551],[3,4.809],[4,5.04],[5,5.339],[6,5.448]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Sorry! Wait a minute.","vi":"Xin